process: zen
title: Zen
a @ Left mouse button: mouse left
b @ Backspace: key back
x @ Right mouse button: mouse right
y @ Media play/pause: key MediaPlayPause norepeat
dpad left @ Left: key left
dpad right @ Right: key right
dpad up @ Up: key up
dpad down @ Down: key down
left thumb @ Show Virtual Keyboard: virtualkeyboard show
right thumb @ Middle mouse button: mouse middle
left stick @ Mouse movement: mouse movement
right stick @ Mouse scroll: mouse scroll
start @ Enter: key enter norepeat
backbutton @ Use Secondary Bindings: modifier back
back guide @ Turn off controller: cmd turnOffController
back y @ Display PC screen only: cmd process displayswitch.exe /internal
back dpad up @ Volume up: key VolumeUp
back dpad down @ Volume down: key VolumeDown
back b @ Escape: key escape norepeat
b @ Right mouse button: mouse right
right thumb @ Open Task Switcher (Ctrl+Alt+Tab): cmd keyCombo LControlKey LMenu Tab
back dpad left @ Shift+1: key LShiftKey+D1 norepeat
back dpad right @ Shift+3: key LShiftKey+D3 norepeat
back b @ Ctrl+3: key LControlKey+D3 norepeat
x @ Backspace: key Back norepeat
back y @ Display extend desktop: cmd process displayswitch.exe /extend
back x @ Ctrl+w: key LControlKey+W norepeat
back a @ Ctrl+t: key LControlKey+T norepeat
back left trigger @ Ctrl+Tab: key LControlKey+Tab norepeat
back right trigger @ Ctrl+Shift+Tab: key LControlKey+LShiftKey+Tab norepeat
back left shoulder @ Alt+Left: key LMenu+Left norepeat
back right shoulder @ Alt+Right: key LMenu+Right norepeat
left trigger @ Ctrl+Tab: key LControlKey+Tab norepeat
right trigger @ Ctrl+Shift+Tab: key LControlKey+LShiftKey+Tab norepeat
left shoulder @ Ctrl+Left: key LControlKey+Left norepeat
right shoulder @ Ctrl+Right: key LControlKey+Right norepeat
back right thumb @ Ctrl+n: key LControlKey+N norepeat
guide @ Ctrl+s: key LControlKey+S norepeat
